      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>On 20 June 1897, Joseph Ezekiel Rajpurkar offered this civic prayer in Hebrew with translations in Marathi and English, on behalf of the congregation of the Gates of Prayer Synagogue (Bombay/Mumbai), for the 50th anniversary of the reign of Queen Victoria over the British Empire.</tei:p>
        <tei:p>If you are literate in Marathi and are capable of typing in Devanagari script, we request your assistance in proofreading the Marathi translation of this prayer. Please share your corrections in the comments or contact us.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
